OL,3,GNEWSADelays as M1 closed after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M1 is closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections after a multi-vehicle crash
OL,8,Fin Leicestershire.
OL,10,FNationals Highway said the road was
OL,11,Fclosed in both direction between
OL,12,Fjunction 21A at Leicester and junction
OL,13,F22 at Coalville following the crash
OL,14,Fshortly before 14:00 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FPolice and The Air Ambulance Service
OL,17,Fare both at the scene of the collision
OL,18,Fwhich happened on the northbound
OL,19,Fcarriageway, they said.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
